#: ../../source/index.rst:48
msgid ""
"q2m3 is a hybrid quantum-classical QM/MM framework for small-molecule quantum chemistry "
"workflows. These workflows combine PySCF, PennyLane QPE circuits, sample-based quantum "
"diagonalization, explicit MM point charges, Monte Carlo solvation, and EFTQC resource estimation."
msgstr ""
"q2m3 是面向小分子量子化学工作流的量子经典混合 QM/MM 框架。这些工作流结合 PySCF、PennyLane QPE 电路、基于采样的量子对角化、显式 MM 点电荷、蒙特卡洛溶剂化和 "
"EFTQC 资源估计。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:53
msgid ""
"Start with the small H2 examples. SQD glycine, Catalyst, H3O+, 8-bit QPE, and dynamic-Trotter "
"diagnostics are optional. They can require much more memory or compilation time."
msgstr "从小规模 H2 示例开始。SQD 甘氨酸、Catalyst、H3O+、8 位 QPE 和动态 Trotter 诊断均为可选内容，可能需要更多内存或更长编译时间。"

